+ordered per stage as (x_k, u_k), the constraints per stage as the dynamics
+constraints (all constraints that depend on x_{k+1}) followed by the other
+constraints of the stage. The number of dynamics constraints of stage k (nf) can
+differ from nx_{k+1}; nf and ng are derived from the sparsity pattern:
+
+     nx0  nu0  nx1  nu1  nx2  nu2
+     -----------------------------
+nf0  |A0  B0   J0
+ng0  |C0  D0
+nf1  |         A1   B1   J1
+ng1  |         C1   D1
+ng2  |                   C2   D2
+
 
 **/
 
